.layout = "content.shtml",
---
Match an exact checkpoint to your accelerator and LLMD release. Check the
[host and backend requirements]($link.page('reference/compatibility'))
and allow memory for both the model weights and KV cache.

# [Checkpoint catalog]($heading.id('choose-a-checkpoint'))

Precision describes the checkpoint weights. The LLMD release identifies the
published recipe. Pulling a Docker backend tag fetches the current image for
that backend. On narrow screens, scroll the table sideways to see all columns.

> []($block.attrs('model-catalog-table'))
>
