The table covers combinations with published recipes. Hardware validation for
this documentation is pending. The [20261106.0 release notes](https://zml.ai/posts/llmd-20261106.0/)
list additional model families. Check [Docker Hub](https://hub.docker.com/r/zmlai/llmd/tags)
for backend tags or the [ZML tap](https://github.com/zml/homebrew-zml)
for the current Metal package.

# [Next steps]($heading.id('next-steps'))

Choose **Configure launch** in a row to preselect its checkpoint and backend,
or open the [LLMD quickstart]($link.page('llmd/quickstart')) to choose a model
source and generate the commands.
